### P5 permission + edit-resubmit acceptance HTTP script
### Usage: VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client / Postman import.
### Replace tokens and ids before execution. Prepared by QA; do not run blindly against production data.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@frontendUrl = http://localhost:5173
@runId = P5-0520-manual

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Tokens: prepare 10 roles. All non-admin tokens MUST NOT include role code "admin".
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
@adminToken = <ADMIN_JWT>
@businessOwnerToken = <BUSINESS_OWNER_OR_BIZ_MANAGER_JWT>
@businessLeaderToken = <BUSINESS_GROUP_LEADER_OR_BIZ_LEADER_JWT>
@businessMemberToken = <BUSINESS_GROUP_MEMBER_OR_BIZ_MEMBER_JWT>
@dataEntryToken = <DATA_ENTRY_LEADER_JWT>
@sharedOwnerToken = <SHARED_TEAM_OWNER_OR_SHARED_LEADER_JWT>
@contractToken = <LABOR_CONTRACT_MEMBER_OR_CONTRACT_SPECIALIST_JWT>
@onboardingToken = <ONBOARDING_RESIGNATION_MEMBER_OR_ONBOARDING_SPECIALIST_JWT>
@socialToken = <SOCIAL_INSURANCE_SPECIALIST_OR_SOCIAL_SECURITY_TEAM_JWT>
@nonAdminToken = <PLAIN_NON_ADMIN_JWT>

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Test ids / mutable values
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
@roleIdForFieldPermissionTest = <ROLE_UUID_USED_ONLY_FOR_FIELD_PERMISSION_TEST>
@exportTemplateId = <EXPORT_TEMPLATE_UUID>
@processingWorkOrderId = <PROCESSING_WORK_ORDER_UUID_CREATED_BY_BUSINESS_MEMBER>
@returnedWorkOrderId = <RETURNED_WORK_ORDER_UUID_CREATED_BY_BUSINESS_MEMBER>
@terminalWorkOrderId = <COMPLETED_OR_VOID_OR_WITHDRAWN_WORK_ORDER_UUID>

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 0. Identity sanity checks: EXPECT 200 and verify role codes manually.
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### admin identity
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### business owner identity - EXPECT no admin role
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{businessOwnerToken}}

### business leader identity - EXPECT no admin role
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{businessLeaderToken}}

### business member identity - EXPECT no admin role
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{businessMemberToken}}

### data entry identity - EXPECT no admin role
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{dataEntryToken}}

### shared owner identity - EXPECT no admin role
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{sharedOwnerToken}}

### contract identity - EXPECT no admin role
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{contractToken}}

### onboarding identity - EXPECT no admin role
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{onboardingToken}}

### social insurance identity - EXPECT no admin role
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{socialToken}}

### plain non-admin identity - EXPECT no admin role
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{nonAdminToken}}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### P5-A Field management permission: admin allowed / all non-admin denied.
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### P5-A-01 admin can read field configs - EXPECT 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/fields?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### P5-A-02 admin can read field permission matrix - EXPECT 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/field-permissions/matrix
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### P5-A-03 admin can write field permission test item - EXPECT 200/201
### Use a disposable role/field only. Revert manually if needed.
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/field-permissions/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "roleId": "{{roleIdForFieldPermissionTest}}",
      "fieldCode": "mobile",
      "scenario": "main",
      "permission": "visible"
    }
  ]
}

### P5-A-04 business owner cannot read fields - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/fields?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{businessOwnerToken}}

### P5-A-05 business leader cannot read field matrix - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/field-permissions/matrix
Authorization: Bearer {{businessLeaderToken}}

### P5-A-06 business member cannot write field permissions - EXPECT 401/403
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/field-permissions/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{businessMemberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "roleId": "{{roleIdForFieldPermissionTest}}",
      "fieldCode": "mobile",
      "scenario": "main",
      "permission": "visible"
    }
  ]
}

### P5-A-07 data entry cannot read fields - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/fields?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{dataEntryToken}}

### P5-A-08 shared owner cannot read fields - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/fields?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{sharedOwnerToken}}

### P5-A-09 contract member cannot read fields - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/fields?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{contractToken}}

### P5-A-10 onboarding member cannot read fields - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/fields?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{onboardingToken}}

### P5-A-11 social insurance member cannot read fields - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/fields?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{socialToken}}

### P5-A-12 plain non-admin cannot read my-field-permissions/admin matrix - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/field-permissions/matrix
Authorization: Bearer {{nonAdminToken}}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### P5-B Export template configuration permission: admin allowed / all non-admin denied.
### Important: both /admin/export-templates and compatible /export-templates must be protected.
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### P5-B-01 admin can read admin export templates - EXPECT 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/export-templates?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### P5-B-02 admin can read compatible export templates path - EXPECT 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/export-templates?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### P5-B-03 admin can create disposable export template - EXPECT 200/201; copy id if cleanup needed
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/export-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "templateName": "P5权限测试模板-{{runId}}",
  "moduleCode": "data_entry",
  "fieldList": [
    { "fieldCode": "employee_name", "fieldName": "员工姓名" },
    { "fieldCode": "id_card_no", "fieldName": "证件号码" }
  ],
  "isShared": false
}

### P5-B-04 business owner cannot read admin export templates - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/export-templates?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{businessOwnerToken}}

### P5-B-05 business leader cannot read compatible export templates - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/export-templates?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{businessLeaderToken}}

### P5-B-06 business member cannot create export template - EXPECT 401/403
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/export-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{businessMemberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "templateName": "非法模板-{{runId}}",
  "moduleCode": "data_entry",
  "fieldList": [ { "fieldCode": "employee_name", "fieldName": "员工姓名" } ],
  "isShared": false
}

### P5-B-07 data entry cannot read export templates - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/export-templates?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{dataEntryToken}}

### P5-B-08 shared owner cannot read export templates - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/export-templates?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{sharedOwnerToken}}

### P5-B-09 contract member cannot read export templates - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/export-templates?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{contractToken}}

### P5-B-10 onboarding member cannot read export templates - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/export-templates?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{onboardingToken}}

### P5-B-11 social insurance member cannot read export templates - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/export-templates?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{socialToken}}

### P5-B-12 plain non-admin cannot read export templates - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/export-templates?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{nonAdminToken}}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### P5-C Portal / dashboard configuration permission: admin allowed / all non-admin denied.
### Current config endpoint: /admin/system-settings/operation-log-retention.
### If /admin/dashboard-config or /admin/portal-config is added later, append same checks.
### Plain dashboard viewing /dashboard/cards is NOT configuration and should not be blocked incorrectly.
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### P5-C-01 admin can read config - EXPECT 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/system-settings/operation-log-retention
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### P5-C-02 admin can update config - EXPECT 200
### Use same/safe retention value in test environment.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/system-settings/operation-log-retention
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "retentionDays": 180
}

### P5-C-03 business owner cannot read config - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/system-settings/operation-log-retention
Authorization: Bearer {{businessOwnerToken}}

### P5-C-04 business leader cannot update config - EXPECT 401/403
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/system-settings/operation-log-retention
Authorization: Bearer {{businessLeaderToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "retentionDays": 90
}

### P5-C-05 business member cannot read config - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/system-settings/operation-log-retention
Authorization: Bearer {{businessMemberToken}}

### P5-C-06 data entry cannot read config - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/system-settings/operation-log-retention
Authorization: Bearer {{dataEntryToken}}

### P5-C-07 shared owner cannot read config - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/system-settings/operation-log-retention
Authorization: Bearer {{sharedOwnerToken}}

### P5-C-08 contract member cannot read config - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/system-settings/operation-log-retention
Authorization: Bearer {{contractToken}}

### P5-C-09 onboarding member cannot read config - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/system-settings/operation-log-retention
Authorization: Bearer {{onboardingToken}}

### P5-C-10 social insurance member cannot read config - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/system-settings/operation-log-retention
Authorization: Bearer {{socialToken}}

### P5-C-11 plain non-admin cannot read config - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/system-settings/operation-log-retention
Authorization: Bearer {{nonAdminToken}}

### P5-C-12 business dashboard viewing must not regress - EXPECT 200 or original role-based result, not blocked because of config permission
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{businessMemberToken}}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### P5-D Edit must force resubmit: UI should confirm, API must prove resubmit/reset.
### Execute only on disposable test work orders.
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### P5-D-00 inspect processing work order before edit - EXPECT status processing and no completed child if testing editable path
GET {{baseUrl}}/work-orders/{{processingWorkOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{businessMemberToken}}

### P5-D-01 inspect timeline before edit
GET {{baseUrl}}/work-orders/{{processingWorkOrderId}}/timeline
Authorization: Bearer {{businessMemberToken}}

### P5-D-02 processing edit via PUT - EXPECT not silent old-flow save.
### Acceptable only if response/timeline proves forced resubmit semantics OR followed POST /resubmit succeeds.
### If PUT changes status to pending and following POST /resubmit returns 409, frontend protocol must be fixed.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/work-orders/{{processingWorkOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{businessMemberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "extraData": {
    "mobile": "13800005200",
    "special_remark": "P5编辑后必须重新提交-{{runId}}"
  }
}

### P5-D-03 explicit resubmit after edit - EXPECT 200 if API contract requires explicit resubmit.
### If this returns 409 because PUT already completed forced resubmit, verify UI does not call this second step.
POST {{baseUrl}}/work-orders/{{processingWorkOrderId}}/resubmit
Authorization: Bearer {{businessMemberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "extraData": {
    "mobile": "13800005200",
    "special_remark": "P5编辑后必须重新提交-{{runId}}"
  }
}

### P5-D-04 inspect processing work order after edit/resubmit - EXPECT pending/processing according to agreed flow, latest fields visible
GET {{baseUrl}}/work-orders/{{processingWorkOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{businessMemberToken}}

### P5-D-05 inspect timeline after edit/resubmit - EXPECT salesperson_modify_resubmit or equivalent audit record
GET {{baseUrl}}/work-orders/{{processingWorkOrderId}}/timeline
Authorization: Bearer {{businessMemberToken}}

### P5-D-06 inspect as backend handler after resubmit - EXPECT pending/new task uses latest field snapshot
GET {{baseUrl}}/my-dispatched?status=pending&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{dataEntryToken}}

### P5-D-07 inspect handler notifications - EXPECT dispatch_resubmit or equivalent notification
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{dataEntryToken}}

### P5-D-08 returned work order explicit resubmit path - EXPECT 200 and reset dispatch/timeline
POST {{baseUrl}}/work-orders/{{returnedWorkOrderId}}/resubmit
Authorization: Bearer {{businessMemberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "extraData": {
    "special_remark": "P5退回后修改并重新提交-{{runId}}"
  }
}

### P5-D-09 terminal work order cannot be edited - EXPECT 409/403
PUT {{baseUrl}}/work-orders/{{terminalWorkOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{businessMemberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "extraData": {
    "special_remark": "P5终态非法修改-{{runId}}"
  }
}

### P5-D-10 terminal work order cannot be resubmitted - EXPECT 409/403
POST {{baseUrl}}/work-orders/{{terminalWorkOrderId}}/resubmit
Authorization: Bearer {{businessMemberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "extraData": {
    "special_remark": "P5终态非法重提-{{runId}}"
  }
}

