Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### P5-E-02 non-admin cannot list workflow config - EXPECT 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/workflows?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{businessMemberToken}}
